{"id": "4370d49b-2723-4b82-af56-d53afa930db3", "slug": "global-commerce-platform", "title": "Global Commerce Platform", "description": "Global Commerce Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Global Commerce Platform\"\ndescription: \"Global Commerce Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#0A2540\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#2563EB\"\n  background: \"#0A2540\"\n  surface: \"#BFDBFE\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Global Commerce Platform\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 40; favorites: 12; remixes: 6.\nTags: hero, section, animated, threejs, cta, effect, webgl.\n## Overview\nGlobal Commerce Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.\n\nThe backbone of global commerce 0 currencies and payment methods supported US$ 0.0 in payments volume processed in 2025 0.000 historical uptime for Stripe services 0 active subscriptions managed on Stripe Billing\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: The backbone of global commerce.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #0A2540, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #2563EB, background #0A2540, surface #BFDBFE, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Global Commerce Platform</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-white text-slate-900 font-sans antialiased overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-blue-100 selection:text-blue-900\">\n\n    <!-- Main Container with Border Lines -->\n    <main class=\"relative max-w-6xl mx-auto border-x border-slate-200 min-h-screen flex flex-col pt-32\">\n\n        <!-- Corner Squares -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 -left-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-slate-200\" style=\"content: ''\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 -right-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-slate-200\" style=\"content: ''\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 -left-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-slate-200 z-20\" style=\"content: ''\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 -right-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-slate-200 z-20\" style=\"content: ''\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Hero Heading -->\n        <section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 pb-24 text-center z-10 relative\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-medium tracking-tight text-slate-900 leading-[1.1] mx-auto max-w-3xl reveal-text\" style=\"color: #0a2540;\">\n                The backbone<br/>of global commerce\n            </h1>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Stats Section -->\n        <section class=\"relative z-10 bg-white\">\n            <!-- Top Separator Line base -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-[1px] bg-slate-200\"></div>\n            <!-- Dynamic Gradient Line (Controlled by JS on hover) -->\n            <div id=\"hover-gradient-line\" class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-blue-500 to-transparent w-1/4 opacity-0 transition-all duration-500 ease-out pointer-events-none\" style=\"transform: translateX(0%);\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 divide-y md:divide-y-0 md:divide-x divide-slate-100 text-center relative\">\n\n                <!-- Stat 1 -->\n                <div class=\"stat-group py-12 px-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center cursor-default transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-slate-50/50\" data-index=\"0\">\n                    <div class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-2 flex items-baseline justify-center\" style=\"color: #0a2540;\">\n                        <span class=\"counter\" data-target=\"135\" data-suffix=\"+\">0</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 font-normal leading-relaxed max-w-[180px]\">\n                        currencies and payment methods supported\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Stat 2 -->\n                <div class=\"stat-group py-12 px-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center cursor-default transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-slate-50/50\" data-index=\"1\">\n                    <div class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight text-slate-600 mb-2 flex items-baseline justify-center\">\n                        <span class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl mr-0.5 font-normal text-slate-500\">US$</span>\n                        <span class=\"counter\" data-target=\"1.9\" data-decimals=\"1\" data-suffix=\"tn\">0.0</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 font-normal leading-relaxed max-w-[180px]\">\n                        in payments volume processed in 2025\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Stat 3 -->\n                <div class=\"stat-group py-12 px-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center cursor-default transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-slate-50/50\" data-index=\"2\">\n                    <div class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight text-slate-400 mb-2 flex items-baseline justify-center\">\n                        <span class=\"counter\" data-target=\"99.999\" data-decimals=\"3\" data-suffix=\"%\">0.000</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 font-normal leading-relaxed max-w-[180px]\">\n                        historical uptime for Stripe services\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Stat 4 -->\n                <div class=\"stat-group py-12 px-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center cursor-default transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-slate-50/50\" data-index=\"3\">\n                    <div class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight text-slate-400 mb-2 flex items-baseline justify-center\">\n                        <span class=\"counter\" data-target=\"200\" data-suffix=\"M+\">0</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 font-normal leading-relaxed max-w-[180px]\">\n                        active subscriptions managed on Stripe Billing\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Separator Line -->\n            <div class=\"w-full h-[1px] bg-slate-200\"></div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Visualization Section -->\n        <section class=\"relative flex-grow flex flex-col overflow-hidden min-h-[600px]\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(100% 100% at 50% 100%, rgba(253, 230, 138, 0.4) 0%, rgba(191, 219, 254, 0.4) 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 100%);\">\n\n            <!-- Controls -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-6 right-6 z-20 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <button class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm border border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900 hover:bg-white transition-colors shadow-sm cursor-pointer\" aria-label=\"Pause Animation\" id=\"pause-btn\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pause-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm border border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900 hover:bg-white transition-colors shadow-sm cursor-pointer\" aria-label=\"Toggle Theme\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:sun-linear\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Canvas Container -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10 w-full h-full flex items-end justify-center pointer-events-auto cursor-crosshair\">\n                <canvas id=\"flower-canvas\" class=\"w-full h-full block\"></canvas>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Ambient glow at bottom -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-32 bg-gradient-to-t from-white to-transparent z-10 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        </section>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // --- Masked Word Reveal Logic ---\n            const heading = document.querySelector('.reveal-text');\n            if (heading) {\n                // Manually split text into words while preserving line breaks\n                const htmlContent = heading.innerHTML;\n                const lines = htmlContent.split('<br>');\n                heading.innerHTML = '';\n\n                lines.forEach((line, lineIndex) => {\n                    const words = line.trim().split(/\\s+/);\n                    words.forEach((word) => {\n                        if(!word) return;\n                        // Create mask container\n                        const wrapper = document.createElement('span');\n                        wrapper.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                        wrapper.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n                        wrapper.style.verticalAlign = 'top';\n                        wrapper.style.marginRight = '0.25em';\n                        wrapper.style.paddingBottom = '0.1em'; // Prevent clipping of descenders\n\n                        // Create inner animated element\n                        const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                        inner.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                        inner.style.transform = 'translateY(110%)';\n                        inner.classList.add('word-inner');\n                        inner.innerHTML = word;\n\n                        wrapper.appendChild(inner);\n                        heading.appendChild(wrapper);\n                    });\n\n                    // Add line break back except for last line\n                    if (lineIndex < lines.length - 1) {\n                        heading.appendChild(document.createElement('br'));\n                    }\n                });\n\n                // Animate words\n                gsap.to('.word-inner', {\n                    y: '0%',\n                    duration: 1,\n                    ease: 'power4.out',\n                    stagger: 0.05,\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: heading,\n                        start: 'top 80%',\n                    }\n                });\n            }\n\n            // --- Number Counter Logic ---\n            const counters = document.querySelectorAll('.counter');\n            let hasAnimated = false;\n\n            const animateNumbers = () => {\n                if (hasAnimated) return;\n                hasAnimated = true;\n\n                counters.forEach(counter => {\n                    const target = parseFloat(counter.getAttribute('data-target'));\n                    const decimals = parseInt(counter.getAttribute('data-decimals')) || 0;\n                    const suffix = counter.getAttribute('data-suffix') || '';\n\n                    let startVal = 0;\n\n                    gsap.to({ val: startVal }, {\n                        val: target,\n                        duration: 2,\n                        ease: 'power2.out',\n                        onUpdate: function() {\n                            // Format number with proper decimals\n                            let current = this.targets()[0].val;\n                            let formatted = current.toFixed(decimals);\n\n                            // Prevent floating point weirdness on .999\n                            if(decimals > 0 && current > target - 0.001) formatted = target.toFixed(decimals);\n\n                            counter.innerText = formatted + suffix;\n                        }\n                    });\n                });\n            };\n\n            // Trigger numbers when in view\n            ScrollTrigger.create({\n                trigger: '.stat-group',\n                start: 'top 90%',\n                onEnter: animateNumbers\n            });\n\n\n            // --- Hover Gradient Line Logic ---\n            const statGroups = document.querySelectorAll('.stat-group');\n            const gradientLine = document.getElementById('hover-gradient-line');\n\n            statGroups.forEach(group => {\n                group.addEventListener('mouseenter', (e) => {\n                    const index = group.getAttribute('data-index');\n                    // Move line to column\n                    gradientLine.style.transform = `translateX(${index * 100}%)`;\n                    gradientLine.style.opacity = '1';\n\n                    // Slightly highlight the number color\n                    const numWrap = group.querySelector('div.text-4xl');\n                    if(numWrap) numWrap.style.color = '#0a2540'; // force darkest color\n                });\n\n                group.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n                    gradientLine.style.opacity = '0';\n                    // Reset color based on original classes\n                    const numWrap = group.querySelector('div.text-4xl');\n                    if(numWrap) numWrap.style.color = '';\n                });\n            });\n\n\n            // --- Canvas Flower Visualization Logic ---\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('flower-canvas');\n            const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d', { alpha: false }); // Optimize\n            let width, height;\n\n            // Particles/Rays array\n            let rays = [];\n            const numRays = 400; // Density of lines\n\n            // Mouse tracking\n            let mouse = { x: -1000, y: -1000, active: false };\n            let isPaused = false;\n\n            // Handle resize\n            function resize() {\n                // Get pixel ratio for sharp rendering\n                const dpr = window.devicePixelRatio || 1;\n                const rect = canvas.parentElement.getBoundingClientRect();\n                width = rect.width;\n                height = rect.height;\n\n                canvas.width = width * dpr;\n                canvas.height = height * dpr;\n                ctx.scale(dpr, dpr);\n\n                initRays();\n            }\n\n            window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n\n            class Ray {\n                constructor() {\n                    // Origin is bottom center\n                    this.originX = width / 2;\n                    this.originY = height + 50;\n\n                    // Angle distribution (semi-circle pointing up)\n                    // Spread slightly more than 180 degrees for a fuller look\n                    this.angle = Math.PI + (Math.random() * Math.PI) * 1.2 - (Math.PI * 0.1);\n\n                    // Length variations\n                    this.baseLength = Math.random() * (height * 0.8) + (height * 0.2);\n                    this.currentLength = 0; // Starts at 0 for initial grow animation\n                    this.targetLength = this.baseLength;\n\n                    // Oscillation for breathing effect\n                    this.phase = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;\n                    this.speed = 0.005 + Math.random() * 0.01;\n\n                    // Physics properties for cursor interaction\n                    this.vx = 0;\n                    this.vy = 0;\n\n                    // Base calculated end position\n                    this.baseEndX = this.originX + Math.cos(this.angle) * this.baseLength;\n                    this.baseEndY = this.originY + Math.sin(this.angle) * this.baseLength;\n\n                    // Actual dynamic end position\n                    this.endX = this.baseEndX;\n                    this.endY = this.baseEndY;\n                }\n\n                update(time) {\n                    if (isPaused) return;\n\n                    // 1. Natural Breathing (oscillate base length slightly)\n                    const breath = Math.sin(time * this.speed + this.phase) * 15;\n                    const animatedBaseLength = this.baseLength + breath;\n\n                    // Recalculate base end point with breathing\n                    this.baseEndX = this.originX + Math.cos(this.angle) * animatedBaseLength;\n                    this.baseEndY = this.originY + Math.sin(this.angle) * animatedBaseLength;\n\n                    // 2. Initial Grow Animation\n                    if (this.currentLength < animatedBaseLength) {\n                        this.currentLength += (animatedBaseLength - this.currentLength) * 0.05;\n                    }\n\n                    // Calculate point position based on current length\n                    let px = this.originX + Math.cos(this.angle) * this.currentLength;\n                    let py = this.originY + Math.sin(this.angle) * this.currentLength;\n\n                    // 3. Mouse Interaction (Distortion / Extrusion)\n                    if (mouse.active) {\n                        const dx = mouse.x - px;\n                        const dy = mouse.y - py;\n                        const distance = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy);\n                        const interactionRadius = 150;\n\n                        if (distance < interactionRadius) {\n                            // Calculate force (closer = stronger push)\n                            const force = (interactionRadius - distance) / interactionRadius;\n                            // Push away from cursor\n                            const pushAngle = Math.atan2(dy, dx);\n\n                            // Apply force to velocity (spring physics)\n                            const pushFactor = 8;\n                            this.vx -= Math.cos(pushAngle) * force * pushFactor;\n                            this.vy -= Math.sin(pushAngle) * force * pushFactor;\n                        }\n                    }\n\n                    // 4. Spring back to base position\n                    const spring = 0.08;\n                    const friction = 0.85;\n\n                    this.vx += (this.baseEndX - this.endX) * spring;\n                    this.vy += (this.baseEndY - this.endY) * spring;\n\n                    this.vx *= friction;\n                    this.vy *= friction;\n\n                    this.endX += this.vx;\n                    this.endY += this.vy;\n\n                    // If not disturbed much, lock to natural breathing position for stability\n                    if (!mouse.active && Math.abs(this.vx) < 0.1 && Math.abs(this.vy) < 0.1) {\n                         this.endX = px;\n                         this.endY = py;\n                    }\n                }\n\n                draw() {\n                    // Gradient based on ray length/position to match reference\n                    // Orange/Yellow at base -> Light Blue -> Darker Blue at tips\n\n                    const gradient = ctx.createLinearGradient(this.originX, this.originY, this.endX, this.endY);\n                    gradient.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.4)');   // amber-400\n                    gradient.addColorStop(0.5, 'rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.3)');  // blue-400\n                    gradient.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.6)');     // blue-600\n\n                    ctx.beginPath();\n                    ctx.moveTo(this.originX, this.originY);\n\n                    // Draw curved line for natural feel (quadratic curve slightly offset)\n                    const cpX = this.originX + (this.endX - this.originX) * 0.5 + Math.cos(this.angle + Math.PI/2) * 20;\n                    const cpY = this.originY + (this.endY - this.originY) * 0.5 + Math.sin(this.angle + Math.PI/2) * 20;\n\n                    // Standard straight line looks cleaner for this specific visual\n                    ctx.lineTo(this.endX, this.endY);\n\n                    ctx.strokeStyle = gradient;\n                    ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n                    ctx.stroke();\n\n                    // Draw dot at the end\n                    ctx.beginPath();\n                    ctx.arc(this.endX, this.endY, 1.5, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                    ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.8)'; // blue dot\n                    ctx.fill();\n                }\n            }\n\n            function initRays() {\n                rays = [];\n                for (let i = 0; i < numRays; i++) {\n                    rays.push(new Ray());\n                }\n            }\n\n            function animate(time) {\n                // Clear background with exact styling\n                ctx.fillStyle = '#ffffff';\n                ctx.fillRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n                // Draw background radial gradient manually on canvas for performance\n                const bgGradient = ctx.createRadialGradient(width/2, height, 0, width/2, height, height);\n                bgGradient.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(253, 230, 138, 0.2)'); // amber\n                bgGradient.addColorStop(0.5, 'rgba(191, 219, 254, 0.15)'); // blue\n                bgGradient.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0)');\n                ctx.fillStyle = bgGradient;\n                ctx.fillRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n                // Update and draw rays\n                // Sort by base length so shorter ones draw on top (cleaner center)\n                rays.sort((a, b) => b.baseLength - a.baseLength).forEach(ray => {\n                    ray.update(time);\n                    ray.draw();\n                });\n\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            }\n\n            // Initialization\n            resize();\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n\n            // Event Listeners for Interaction\n            canvas.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n                mouse.x = e.clientX - rect.left;\n                mouse.y = e.clientY - rect.top;\n                mouse.active = true;\n            });\n\n            canvas.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n                mouse.active = false;\n                mouse.x = -1000;\n                mouse.y = -1000;\n            });\n\n            // Controls logic\n            const pauseBtn = document.getElementById('pause-btn');\n            pauseBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                isPaused = !isPaused;\n                pauseBtn.innerHTML = isPaused\n                    ? '<iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>'\n                    : '<iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pause-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>';\n            });\n\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "global-commerce-platform.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/global-commerce-platform.jpg", "source_name": "global-commerce-platform-DESIGN.md", "views": 252, "forks": 15, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T18:14:56.722645+00:00"}